/Orca 通用编排者持续推进协议.md
/迁移整理提示词.md
/agent.md
/docs/roles/
/docs/sop/
/docs/templates/
/docs/prompts/
/docs/assets/orca-*.png
/docs/model/TASK-MANAGER-QUALIFICATION.md
/docs/pm/*.template.md
/docs/plan/*.template.md
/docs/qa/*.template.md
/docs/review/*.template.md
/docs/handoff/*.template.md
/scripts/model/
